# ZVIEW01: zView started by #Z (C:\ZVIEW\ZVIEW.NAP), File > Browser...
# (menu " zView  File  Edit  View  Help", 640x480); the browser opens on
# zView's start directory C:\ZVIEW (folders CODECS, ICONS, SAMPLES; files).
# Ticks hz_200 after zView's first poll.
100 parkbr
3000 mark Z00_IDLE
3100 move 76 8
3400 mark Z01_MENU
3500 move 100 28
3700 down
3703 up
6000 mark Z02_BROWSER
9000 mark Z03_LATER
# a single click on the first tile (folder) selects it (its name drawn WHITE
# on the selection, catalog.c:1020); a click on the tree's expander arrow of
# drive C opens its folder list (catalog_mini_entry.c:192/195)
9100 move 258 110
9300 down
9303 up
10300 mark Z04_SELECTED
10400 move 10 73
10600 down
10603 up
12000 mark Z05_TREE
12100 parkbr
12400 mark END
